chi.co/blogs/01JHJ4HTX3GCJTKWNRDWPPMCNP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ4HW89N8QBMBYK5J7Z5E1J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました(・ω・)　かとし"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15529":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようこんにちこんばんわ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンション可笑しいのは特徴ですよ！いいこといいこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいきなり冷静になるからこの温度差やばいのですよ(。・v・。)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/05/2734785/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑（心の底にいる私はこんな感じ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この画像みたいなテンションから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーぁーーうきゅみたいなテンションまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんついてこれるかな（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜの勢い ＼止まらんぜ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜの勢い ＼止まらんぜ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15才 中学3年生のらんらんこと寺田蘭世です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のブログでのコメントは初コメの方が多かったので嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとブログを書いて思ったことは、自分らしさを大切にもっといろんな私を見て貰いたいなと改めて感じられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人に? 蘭世らしく ?楽しみながらブログ書いて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}